'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信小程序成长计划正式接入腾讯混元Hy3 preview模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI将Codex模型集成至ChatGPT移动端，支持开发者远程控制代码任务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Netflix秘密组建生成式AI动画工作室INKubator，旨在生产电影级内容</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布Qoder 1.0，正式从AI IDE升级为智能体自主开发工作台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c8182eed4918a2beab88e7a5824c0b8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月15日，阿里云正式发布Qoder 1.0，标志着产品从传统AI IDE向“智能体自主开发工作台”转型。该版本引入Agent-first工作范式，用户定义需求后，Agent团队可自主完成执行、验证及交付。核心亮点包括Quest独立视窗，支持任务管理、状态追踪与产物审查；底层重构Agent Harness，将对话模式升级为结构化任务运行时，支撑跨项目多任务并行。新版本首创团队级知识引擎，整合记忆系统、Repo Wiki与知识卡片，实测代码保留率提升11%，Token消耗降低40%。此外，Expert专家团模式支持用户自定义规划、编码与测试团队。自2025年8月上线以来，Qoder已服务全球超500万用户。此次升级推动开发模式从“AI辅助”向“Agent自主交付”演进，显著提升企业级软件生产力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度成立“模型委员会”统筹大模型全局，年轻研究员掌舵，推动技术与应用一体化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/71b5cfb7a9d337b39ee10fb3a51d3e01.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度成立“模型委员会”统筹大模型全局，年轻研究员掌舵，推动技术与应用一体化AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 15, 202663在大模型竞争从单点突破转向体系化作战的关键阶段，百度近日宣布成立**百度模型委员会**（Baidu Model Committee， BMC），作为公司大模型战略的最高决策与协调机构。该委员会由一批对大模型技术有深刻理解的**年轻研究员**组成，基础模型研发部（BMU）与应用模型研发部（AMU）将直接向其汇报，实现从底层技术研发到上层产品落地的全链路统一管理。这一组织架构调整，标志着百度正以“集中优势兵力打歼灭战”的思路，应对日益激烈的AI竞争。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信小程序成长计划正式接入腾讯混元Hy3 preview模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3bd456124300404d16f42ed6b7d7af40.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信小程序“成长计划”于5月15日完成模型升级，正式全面接入腾讯混元Hy3 preview模型。此次更新旨在通过更强大的AI能力，提升开发者在小程序生态内的智能化开发与运营体验。开发者现可调用Hy3 preview版本，利用其增强的逻辑推理与上下文理解能力，优化小程序内的AI助手、内容自动化生成及个性化推荐等核心功能。官方同步发布了模型升级指南，旨在通过技术赋能显著降低开发者的技术门槛。此次接入标志着微信小程序生态在智能化进程上的进一步深化，通过引入更先进的LLM技术，帮助开发者更高效地构建具备复杂交互与智能决策能力的应用，从而提升整体运营效率与用户体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI将Codex模型集成至ChatGPT移动端，支持开发者远程控制代码任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/287eb0489eec103665e0288844ae47b3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式将Codex模型集成至iOS和Android版ChatGPT应用，旨在为开发者提供远程管理与监控编码任务的移动端解决方案。目前Codex周活跃用户已超400万。该功能支持连接个人电脑、Mac mini及云端开发服务器，实现跨设备无缝同步，开发者可实时查看活跃线程、项目上下文、代码差异及测试结果，并能直接在手机端发起新任务或审批命令。为保障安全性，OpenAI引入了安全中继技术，避免开发环境直接暴露于公共互联网。该功能目前已开启分阶段推送，首批支持与macOS桌面端协同工作。此次更新打破了开发者的办公桌束缚，使其能够利用碎片化时间处理紧急编码需求，显著提升了移动端工作流的管理效率与灵活性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Netflix秘密组建生成式AI动画工作室INKubator，旨在生产电影级内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4d76edec5aaedab252063edd17f10217.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Netflix已于2026年3月秘密启动名为INKubator（简称INK）的动画工作室，该部门由曾任职于DreamWorks Animation和A24的Serrena Iyer领导。INKubator的核心定位为“生成式AI原生”，旨在构建支持GenAI的创作工作流、艺术家工具及可扩展的跨剧集制作环境，目标是产出具备长篇电影品质的内容。与此前收购的侧重后期制作的InterPositive不同，INKubator致力于从头构建AI驱动的完整创作流程。目前，Netflix正为该部门大规模招聘制片人、软件工程师和CG艺术家。此举标志着Netflix在AI领域的布局从辅助工具转向内容核心，预示着AI生成内容将深度介入其动画制作板块，对流媒体行业的内容生产模式产生深远影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
